Member success photos go in this directory.

  - Any .jpg / .jpeg / .png / .webp / .avif is picked up automatically; there is no list
    to update and no database row to add.
  - Files render in FILENAME order, so prefix them: 01-, 02-, 03-.
  - The name after that prefix becomes the alt text, so make it descriptive:
    02-prismatic-evolutions-cases.jpg reads as "Member haul - prismatic evolutions cases".
  - Crop roughly square and compress before committing. They are served from the container
    image, so every megabyte here is a megabyte in every deploy.
  - Nothing renders at all when this directory holds no images, so the page is never left
    with an empty heading.

See src/components/member-success.tsx.
